sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant M as Mobile app
  participant L as Local SQLite
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  S->>M: Download lesson pack (online)
  M->>API: GET /sync/pull?since=t0
  API->>DB: Changed lessons, resources, practice
  API-->>M: Changes + new cursor t1
  M->>L: Store content and cursor
  Note over S,L: Connection lost
  S->>M: Answer practice and submit work
  M->>L: Save to outbox with client IDs
  Note over S,L: Connection back
  M->>API: POST /sync/push (outbox operations)
  loop each operation
    API->>DB: Skip if client ID already applied, else apply
  end
  API-->>M: Accepted and rejected IDs
  M->>L: Clear accepted operations
  M->>API: GET /sync/pull?since=t1
  API-->>M: New grades and content
